    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Paulo waatongʼorera matso hara angambi achiamba, “Enehu, mino námhumikira Mlungu kpwa nia nono siku hizo zosi hadi rero.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho hipho Anania, mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, walagiza atu okala aimire phephi na Paulo, amuwange kofi ra mromo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 23:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Paulo achimuamba, “Mlungu andakupiga we mwenye. Uwe mnafiki udzihendaye mutu mzuri. Unanihukumu na Shariya za Musa, ela mbavi unalonda atu avundze Shariya, kpwa kualagiza anipige.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu ambao kala aimire phephi na Paulo amuamba, “Unalaphiza mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu wa Mlungu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.22.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 22:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Paulo waamba, “Poreni enehu, simanyire kama ni mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu. Mana hata Maandiko ga Mlungu ganaamba, ‘Usigombe mai kuhusu mtawala wa atuo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chitabu cha Kutsama 22:29.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
